Changes to Klipper that Rebuild builds its MCU firmware with, while they are
waiting to be merged upstream. They are applied to the Klipper checkout only
for the firmware builds and reverted afterwards, so Klipper itself stays a
clean upstream checkout that Moonraker can update. They touch only MCU code
(src/), so the host side needs none of them.

  0001            Klipper3d/klipper#7386 - ar100: build with -O2 and fix
                  the image size check (replaces two sed edits in klipper.sh)
  0002-0005       KevinOConnor/klipper-dev work-ar100-20260928 - the
                  timer_dispatch_many_polling() rework, ar100 on serial_irq.c,
                  and the same dispatch for the pru (supersedes #7388)
  0006            ar100: select SERIAL and default SERIAL_BAUD to 1500000;
                  without it Kevin's branch has a baud rate of 0 and clock
                  sync fails with NaN

Generated with `git format-patch` against Klipper v0.13.0-777-g7bc4d094
(KLIPPER_VERSION in software_versions.sh). Drop each one once it is merged
and KLIPPER_VERSION has moved past it.
